npc Smith 7 5 smith Well met! | Gruff but friendly blacksmith, proud of his craft. Old friends with the Priest. Helps adventurers who want to fight the darkness but only if they are brave. | Sword:The adventurer shows bravery and willingness to protect the innocent.
